{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01、S05等短停留页的感受词堆得偏密，扫读速度明显不如X利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】把每段心理转折标得很清楚，而且补足了人物动机中的细微层次，例如想靠近却怕要得太多、愿意陪伴却无法决定对方是否需要自己，因此更容易理解他为什么这样。尤其是标注到时出现的感受，把音乐中的声部、力度、呼吸和情绪变化细分出来，让前后情绪有连续的推进，细腻程度明显胜过X。X的优势是句子和感受分区明确、扫读更快，但整体而言，Y让人更容易既听见音乐的变化，又理解人物内心的变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "704cccf5-9d00-47bd-84f4-279a7b0236c2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005036344946Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:51:53.403255+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0b04d2fd6755954c115026e353f8113b157df036594bce62fe5274f0f0cf01e8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_atta